A fun prompt for visualizing manga and stories in general. Tested with Nano Banana 2.1

2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 Chainsaw man like but lesser known manga: // PHYSX PARTICLE EMITTER LOGIC
const scene = new Simulation({ environment: "Messy wooden desk" });
const medium = new RigidBody("AI_INFER(Antique book/map of [FRANCHISE/STORY])");

// KINETIC EVENT: 4th Wall Break
const hero = new KinematicBody("AI_INFER(Photorealistic 3D hero of [FRANCHISE/STORY])");
hero.applyImpulse({ vector: [0, 100, 50], action: "Lunging out of 2D medium" });

// DEBRIS SPAWNER
const explosion = new ParticleSystem({
    origin: hero.point_of_impact,
    elements: "AI_INFER(Torn paper, playing cards, dust, splinters)",
    velocity: "Explosive radial scatter",
    freeze_frame: true
});

// UI MESH INJECTION
scene.addMesh("AI_INFER(Bold, comic-book 3D sound effect word floating at impact point)");

